// Silk Waves: a built-in Lumtub skin. Slow silky waves of light over deep blue and thin quiet icons, after the wave menus of 2000s handheld and home consoles.
// skins/template/skin.jsonc explains every field, and skins/README.md how to make your own.
// 丝绸波浪：Lumtub 内置皮肤。深蓝底上缓缓流过的丝绸光波和安静的细线图标，致敬 2000 年代掌机和主机的波浪菜单。
